{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22287","headline":"玩新庭树因咏所怀 · 白居易","name":"玩新庭树因咏所怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霭霭四月初，新树叶成阴。\n动摇风景丽，盖覆庭院深。\n下有无事人，竟日此幽寻。\n岂惟玩时物，亦可开烦襟。\n时与道人语，或听诗客吟。\n度春足芳色，入夜多鸣禽。\n偶得幽闲境，遂忘尘俗心。\n始知真隐者，不必在山林。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22287.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22287","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}